{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Honor explicit deployment overrides during validation**\n\nCore applies `--parameter-overrides` after extension parameters, so `TelemetryLogGroupName=/custom` is deployed successfully, but this resolver still queries the dedicated flag or default group. The exporter and validator then use different groups and the case falsely reports no records. Resolve the final explicit parameter value here, or reject conflicting generic overrides before deployment.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABArnaag","finding_digest":"f95605e03ce56531806d42149a9ca6f11e95736caf4732d77465d108675f0e06","finding_id":"arf_v1_7flalyb44vstdadniikjvhfg6e","finding_key":"telemetry/extension.py::_resolve_log_group::explicit-parameter-precedence","identity_key":"telemetry/extension.py::_resolve_log_group::explicit-parameter-precedence","line":162,"observation_digest":"a5efd55d5c72ef3d098a3ccd5f7b4fe7602660cfaafd2286505a62be756d1274","observation_id":"aro_v1_uxx5kxk4olxt2cmkhtgv662p45","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-telemetry/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_telemetry/extension.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-21T18:53:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fm7oviql6wego5jpcnduindzqh","reviewed_base_sha":"37656dd6f43d565d8e90e22f3554faa7c92dcb01","reviewed_head_sha":"765d19140bc5a0ca60870695fcd82c9fb22cfba5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":158,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":144},"record_id":"art_v1_cmrzw3vac2jrzcpj3yfntodiqg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-21T18:53:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
